{"title":"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A ferry boat shuttles tourists to an island every hour starting at 10 AM until its last trip, which starts at 3 PM. One day the boat captain notes that on the 10 AM trip there were 100 tourists on the ferry boat, and that on each successive trip, the number of tourists was 1 fewer than on the previous trip. How many tourists did the ferry take to the island that day?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/5/535afaf37569365688906159ec6350ba88aa3fec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 585 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 594 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 672 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 679 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 694$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"440\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It is easy to see that the ferry boat takes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> trips total. The total number of people taken to the island is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/3/633cdf4409a0f09a8e771cd64dd4b6cd02e6402b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;100+99+98+97+96+95\\\\  &amp;=6(100)-(1+2+3+4+5)\\\\  &amp;=600 - 15\\\\  &amp;=\\boxed{585\\ \\textbf{(A)}}\\end{align*}\" width=\"242\" height=\"103\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>You can notice that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/4/514cf539eb748adca651415679a35f18d17d5fab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;100 + 95 = 99 + 96 = 98 + 97 = 195\\end{align*}\" width=\"282\" height=\"14\" />\nThis means that the sum is:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/e/5ee9c1c9c599fc9d3d1b4103afe1f55fa361a43b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;100+99+98+97+96+95\\\\  &amp;=195 * 3\\\\  &amp;=\\boxed{585\\ \\textbf{(A)}}\\end{align*}\" width=\"227\" height=\"78\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TLtqy-62TKo?si=vWBMLRKfpbOZ3C9P\">https://youtu.be/TLtqy-62TKo?si=vWBMLRKfpbOZ3C9P</a>\n</p><p>~Charles3829\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A\">2010 AMC 12A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"